+# Axolot Client 0.15.1 — Nova UI Rebuild Preview
+
+- Rebuilt Home into a responsive desktop launcher dashboard.
+- Removed the fixed 1500px workspace ceiling.
+- Window can resize and maximize normally.
+- Sidebar expands as an overlay and never pushes page content.
+- Standardized readable typography and panel spacing across Library, Mods, Servers, Performance, Accounts, Core, Activity and Settings.
+- Preserves the 0.15.0 launcher backend and Axolot Core feature set.
+
+This is a UI preview build. Keep 0.15.0 as the stable auto-update channel until the layout is approved.
